WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.465 --> 00:00:12.303
We will now perform the Hama ritual
to remove the evil aura of the Shiryu.

00:00:55.722 --> 00:00:56.556
Oh no!

00:01:07.192 --> 00:01:08.193
Blood.

00:01:09.027 --> 00:01:10.570
Need more blood.

00:01:11.613 --> 00:01:14.699
The evil... overtook him?

00:01:36.262 --> 00:01:37.889
More blood.

00:01:58.952 --> 00:02:00.161
I'll hold them.

00:02:02.747 --> 00:02:05.250
Pregnant ladies don't carry anything.

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:07.627
Daddy is so reliable, huh?

00:02:08.586 --> 00:02:11.172
Hey, about the name--

00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:16.594
Takashi?

00:02:25.937 --> 00:02:27.272
Takashi!

00:02:27.772 --> 00:02:31.317
No! No!

00:02:31.693 --> 00:02:34.779
-Takashi! Takashi!
-Blood.

00:02:35.530 --> 00:02:37.323
More blood.

